Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> programa
Rule 1     programa -> reservar
Rule 2     programa -> consultar
Rule 3     programa -> cancelar
Rule 4     programa -> disponibilidade
Rule 5     reservar -> RESERVAR recurso STRING DATA DATE HORA_INICIO TIME HORA_FIM TIME
Rule 6     consultar -> CONSULTAR RESERVAS
Rule 7     consultar -> CONSULTAR RESERVAS ATIVAS
Rule 8     consultar -> CONSULTAR RESERVAS CANCELADAS
Rule 9     recurso -> SALA
Rule 10    recurso -> LABORATORIO
Rule 11    recurso -> EQUIPAMENTO
Rule 12    cancelar -> CANCELAR RESERVA recurso NUMBER
Rule 13    disponibilidade -> DISPONIBILIDADE recurso DATA DATE HORA_INICIO TIME HORA_FIM TIME

Terminals, with rules where they appear

ATIVAS               : 7
CANCELADAS           : 8
